<title>UK: Tomkins H1 pretax profit rises 33.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Tomkins H1 pretax profit rises 33.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Nov 2, 1996</p>
<p>(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,896.3		vs 1,733.9</p>
<p> Earnings per share     8.49p		  up 17.8 pct</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    168.8		  126.1</p>
<p> Net dividend	     3.06p		  2.70p</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Tomkins Plc.</p>
</text>
